>>
endobj
418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (So have rough ideas, sure. Stay curious about everything. Work hard at what's in front of you right now. But stop beating yourself up for not having a five year plan when you've barely lived five years of real independence. The adults pressuring you for answers figured it out gradually, messily, and much later than they'd like to admit.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
